        <li>Transfer the materials to another person or "mirror" the materials on any other server.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This licence shall automatically terminate if you violate any of these restrictions and may be terminated by Finicium Capital LTD at any time without notice.</p>

      <h2>5. User Conduct</h2>
      <p>You agree not to use this website in any way that:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Violates any applicable local, national, or international law or regulation.</li>
        <li>Is fraudulent, deceptive, or misleading.</li>
        <li>Infringes upon the rights of any third party.</li>
        <li>Interferes with or disrupts the integrity or performance of the website.</li>
